  "墙高 × 投影机长宽比（16:10 为 1.6）。": {
    "en": "Wall height × projector aspect ratio (16:10 is 1.6)."
  },
  "每款可配镜头算最短距离 = 投射比 × 画面宽，取放得进可用进深、投射比最小的（人影少）。": {
    "en": "For each compatible lens, shortest distance = throw ratio × image width; take the smallest throw ratio that fits the available depth (fewer shadows)."
  },
  "定焦镜头：实际画面宽 = 安装距离 ÷ 投射比，高 = 宽 ÷ 长宽比。": {
    "en": "Fixed lens: actual image width = mount distance ÷ throw ratio; height = width ÷ aspect ratio."
  },
  "ceil((墙宽 − 画面宽) ÷ (画面宽 × (1 − 融合下限))) + 1，至少 1 台。": {
    "en": "ceil((wall width − image width) ÷ (image width × (1 − blend minimum))) + 1, at least 1."
  },
  "1 − (墙宽 − 画面宽) ÷ ((台数 − 1) × 画面宽)，要在融合上下限之间。": {
    "en": "1 − (wall width − image width) ÷ ((count − 1) × image width); must be between the blend limits."
  },
  "实际画面高 ≥ 墙高。": {
    "en": "Actual image height ≥ wall height."
  },
  "台数 × 横向像素 − (台数 − 1) × 融合带 × 横向像素。": {
    "en": "Count × native width − (count − 1) × blend × native width."
  },
  "墙宽 ÷ 横向像素；最近观看距离小于像素尺寸 × 每 mm 米数时提示清晰度不够。": {
    "en": "Wall width ÷ horizontal pixels; a note when the nearest viewing distance is below pixel size × metres per mm."
  },
  "目标亮度 × π × 单台画面面积 ÷ 幕面增益 ÷ 折减；投影机流明要不低于此值。": {
    "en": "Target brightness × π × image area ÷ surface gain ÷ derate; the projector must have at least this many lumens."
  },
  "从镜头到画面底边的光线，按人高检查离墙多远以内会挡光。": {
    "en": "The ray from the lens to the image bottom: how close to the wall a person of the given height casts a shadow."
  },
  "2 台及以上必须用融合器，输出路数 ≥ 台数。": {
    "en": "Two or more projectors need a blender with outputs ≥ count."
  },
  "距离 ≤ HDMI 上限用 HDMI；不超过光纤门槛用 HDBaseT；更远用光纤 HDMI；项目有 AV 网络时用 AVoIP。": {
    "en": "HDMI up to the HDMI limit; HDBaseT up to the fiber threshold; fiber HDMI beyond; AVoIP when the site has an AV network."
  },
  "(台数 × 投影机功率 + 机房功率) × (1 + 余量) ÷ 每回路功率，向上取整。": {
    "en": "(count × projector power + server room power) × (1 + margin) ÷ power per circuit, rounded up."
  },
  "画布 = 拼接横向像素 × 纵向像素；时长和场景数由人填。": {
    "en": "Canvas = blended horizontal × vertical pixels; duration and scenes are filled in by hand."
  },
  "视频线 = 台数，控制线（PJLink）= 台数；每类备用 max(最少数, 台数 × 备用比例 向上取整)。": {
    "en": "Video lines = count, control lines (PJLink) = count; spares per type max(minimum, count × spare rate rounded up)."
  },
  "每台投影 1 个 13A 电源点；机房设备功率 × (1 + 余量)；方案 A 预留插座，方案 B UPS。": {
    "en": "One 13A outlet per projector; server room power × (1 + margin); option A spare outlets, option B a UPS."
  },
  "视频线 = 控制线 = 台数；融合器输出 ≥ 台数；和原方案的数量核对；投影只用网络指令待机，不直接断电。": {
    "en": "Video lines = control lines = count; blender outputs ≥ count; checked against the design's counts; projectors go to standby by network command, never by cutting power."
  },
